<article class="offering-card consulting-card">
            <div class="offering-photo">
              <img src="/assets/images/consulting.png" alt="RV consulting with Professor Jerry" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="offering-body">
              <!-- Original wording
<h2>RV Consulting / Diagnosing Problems</h2>
-->
              <h2 id="consulting">RV Consulting &amp; Troubleshooting</h2>
              <!-- Original wording
<p>This offering is one-on-one Q &amp; A regarding just about any topic I can help you with related to RVing. This also applies to diagnosing problems with your RV.</p>
-->
              <p>Get one-on-one help with RV ownership, system operation, or a problem you are trying to diagnose. Bring
                your questions, and we will work through them together.</p>
              <!-- Original wording
<p>Since many RV owners are DIYers, I am also available as an experienced onsite mentor while you make repairs or upgrades to your own RV.</p>
-->
              <p>Prefer to do your own work? I can serve as an experienced onsite mentor while you make repairs or
                upgrades to your RV.</p>
              <!-- Original wording
<p>Repairs I perform following a diagnosis are charged separately.</p>
-->
              <p>The consulting fee covers advice and troubleshooting. Any repair work I perform is charged separately.
              </p>
              <div class="offering-price"><rv:price regular="75" discount="<%= GRAND_OPENING_PERCENT %>" /> per hour<br><rv:price regular="40" discount="<%= GRAND_OPENING_PERCENT %>" prefix="+" /> trip charge</div>
            </div>
          </article>
